{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12103320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12103320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210332001:1":{"text":"앞에 있는 작은 다리를 지나서 계속 서쪽으로 가다 보면 블러디 로즈의 조선소가 나올 거야.","source_cn":"过了前面的小木桥，继续往西，就是血薇帮的造船厂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48F67406585683FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210332002:1":{"text":"엄청나게 위험해 보이네요...","source_cn":"听起来很危险……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E79FF19AA0D93B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210332003:1":{"text":"왜, 겁나?","source_cn":"怕啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B420186F7906FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1210332003":{"text":"왜, 겁나?","source_cn":"怕啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B420186F7906FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210332005:1":{"text":"아직은 경계를 늦춰선 안 돼요. 최대한 빨리 이곳을 떠나는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"现在还不能放松警惕，还是早点离开这里比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDDBB6015BC65292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210332006:1":{"text":"자, 다들 힘내자고. 이제 곧 조선소에 도착할 거야. 진정한 모험은 이제부터 시작이야.","source_cn":"打起精神各位，快到造船厂了。真正的冒险，现在才开始呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B0B4FB2EFEABC9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"겁먹을 거 뭐가 있어","source_cn":"没什么可怕的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB9B9257C53549DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"겁먹을 거 뭐가 있어","female":"겁먹을 거 뭐가 있어","variant_male_record_index":"64984","variant_female_record_index":"64985","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210332004:1":{"text":"진짜 없어. 조선소 남쪽의 물길로 도망칠 거 아니면 원래 왔던 길로 돌아가야 해. 내 생각엔 아무래도 이쪽이 더 안전한 것 같아.","source_cn":"真没有，要么从造船厂南边的水路溜走，要么原路返回。要我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D1E17D503B91BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"다른 길은 없는 거야?","source_cn":"就没有别的路吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x24A2361AF3CB7237","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 길은 없는 거야?","female":"다른 길은 없는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"64986","variant_female_record_index":"64987","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}